1. A system for managing communications bandwidth on a moving platform, the system comprising:

a wireless communication interface configured to communicate data between the moving platform and a remote network over at least one wireless link;

a plurality of applications executing on one or more processors of the moving platform, each application being configured to generate application data for transmission over the at least one wireless link; and

a bandwidth management module executable by the one or more processors and configured to:

determine an available bandwidth of the at least one wireless link while the moving platform is in motion;

allocate respective bandwidth availability information to the plurality of applications based at least in part on the determined available bandwidth; and

provide the respective bandwidth availability information to the plurality of applications;

wherein each of the plurality of applications is configured, in response to receiving the respective bandwidth availability information, to adapt an amount, rate, format, resolution, compression level, priority, or type of application data transmitted by the application over the at least one wireless link.

1. A method for managing transmission of application data on a mobile platform, the method comprising:

receiving, by one or more processors of the mobile platform, performance data associated with at least one wireless communication link available to the mobile platform;

determining, based at least in part on the performance data, an available bandwidth for transmitting application data associated with an application executing on the mobile platform;

comparing the available bandwidth with one or more bandwidth requirements or thresholds associated with the application data;

generating, based at least in part on the comparison, a quality-of-service notification indicative of a transmission condition for the application data; and

adjusting, in response to the quality-of-service notification, one or more application parameters of the application to adapt transmission of the application data over the at least one wireless communication link.
